    "type_designations": ["PR 6204"],
    "module_designation": "Digital load cell",
    "description": "Digital strain gauge compression load cell. The load cells of the series PR 6204 are compact compression load cells for self-centering pendulum applications. The strain gauge application is hermetically sealed; the deep-drawn and micro plasma welded housing is made of stainless steel and filled with inert gas. The analog signal of the strain gauge bridge is amplified, scaled and filtered by the integrated module. The load cell is equipped with an interface RS485. To use the load cell it has to be connected to the junction box of the type PR6024/64S or to the junction box of the type PR6024/68S. The junction box has to be connected to the digital data processing device of the type TN-PRO."
